"<div id=""mindx-medical-necessity-checker"">

<h2>Medical Necessity Documentation Checker</h2>

<div class=""subtitle"">
Review your therapy note for the core elements that support medical necessity and continued behavioral health services.
</div>

<form id=""medicalNecessityForm"">

<div class=""section"">

<h3>1. Clinical Symptoms & Concerns</h3>

<label>
<input type=""checkbox"">
The note identifies relevant symptoms, concerns, or clinical problems.
</label>

<label>
<input type=""checkbox"">
The symptoms are described with sufficient clinical detail.
</label>

<label>
<input type=""checkbox"">
The note documents meaningful changes in symptoms when applicable.
</label>

<label>
<input type=""checkbox"">
The documented concerns are relevant to the client’s treatment.
</label>

</div>


<div class=""section"">

<h3>2. Functional Impact</h3>

<label>
<input type=""checkbox"">
The note describes how symptoms affect functioning.
</label>

<label>
<input type=""checkbox"">
Relevant areas such as work, school, relationships, self-care, or daily functioning are addressed when applicable.
</label>

<label>
<input type=""checkbox"">
The level of impairment or difficulty is clinically understandable.
</label>

</div>


<div class=""section"">

<h3>3. Clinical Interventions</h3>

<label>
<input type=""checkbox"">
Specific therapeutic interventions are documented.
</label>

<label>
<input type=""checkbox"">
The interventions are clinically appropriate for the documented concerns.
</label>

<label>
<input type=""checkbox"">
The therapist’s clinical work is distinguishable from general supportive conversation.
</label>

<label>
<input type=""checkbox"">
The client’s response to interventions is documented.
</label>

</div>


<div class=""section"">

<h3>4. Treatment Goals & Plan</h3>

<label>
<input type=""checkbox"">
The session is connected to the treatment plan.
</label>

<label>
<input type=""checkbox"">
Progress toward treatment goals is documented when applicable.
</label>

<label>
<input type=""checkbox"">
Barriers, setbacks, or lack of progress are documented when clinically relevant.
</label>

<label>
<input type=""checkbox"">
The plan for continued treatment or next steps is documented.
</label>

</div>


<div class=""section"">

<h3>5. Clinical Rationale</h3>

<label>
<input type=""checkbox"">
The note provides a clear clinical rationale for the services provided.
</label>

<label>
<input type=""checkbox"">
The documentation supports why the intervention was appropriate at this point in treatment.
</label>

<label>
<input type=""checkbox"">
The note supports the need for continued care when continued treatment is indicated.
</label>

</div>


<div class=""section"">

<h3>6. Risk & Safety</h3>

<label>
<input type=""checkbox"">
Risk assessment is documented when clinically indicated.
</label>

<label>
<input type=""checkbox"">
Relevant protective factors are documented when applicable.
</label>

<label>
<input type=""checkbox"">
Safety planning or intervention is documented when applicable.
</label>

</div>


<div class=""section"">

<h3>7. Documentation Quality</h3>

<label>
<input type=""checkbox"">
The note is specific rather than vague or overly generic.
</label>

<label>
<input type=""checkbox"">
The documentation is consistent with the client’s treatment plan and clinical presentation.
</label>

<label>
<input type=""checkbox"">
The note avoids unsupported statements or unnecessary personal details.
</label>

<label>
<input type=""checkbox"">
The documentation is complete and internally consistent.
</label>

</div>


<button type=""button"" onclick=""checkMedicalNecessity()"">
Review Documentation
</button>

</form>

<div id=""medicalNecessityResults""></div>

<div class=""note"">
This tool is for documentation quality and self-review only. It does not determine medical necessity, guarantee reimbursement, or replace payer requirements, clinical judgment, legal guidance, or applicable regulations.
</div>

</div>


<style>

#mindx-medical-necessity-checker{
max-width:800px;
margin:auto;
padding:30px;
background:#f8f9fc;
border-radius:20px;
font-family:'Segoe UI',sans-serif;
}

#mindx-medical-necessity-checker h2{
